  "description": "State-of-the-art e-bike technology and uncompromising performance – we developed the Vuca EVO AM 3 for those who want only the best. With integrated 12-speed gearbox and automatic shifting, the revolutionary Pinion MGU combines powerful off-road assistance with high-precision gear changes – all with minimal maintenance. A closer look at the component list reveals that every part is a highlight. But in the end, it's the sum of the parts that determines performance – and in this respect, the Vuca EVO AM 3 is unrivalled! With the innovative 4-link swingarm rear suspension of the newly developed carbon frame and Fox Float Factory suspension, you'll become one with the trail. The high-quality Galfer Shark brakes and 8Pins Dropper Post also play their part. And there's light for even more trails and the ride home – fully integrated into the head tube and dropouts. The Vuca EVO AM 3 – when state-of-the-art e-bike technology and the best possible components create excitement.",
